# SYNOPSIS

```text
protocol todhchai.auth.Factotum version 1
call startSession(pattern: String, role: Role, session: Handle)
  throws(AuthError)
call publicKey(pattern: String) throws(AuthError) -> [UInt8]
```

# DESCRIPTION

Protocol `todhchai.auth.Factotum`, version 1, of library `AuthIPC`, its messages in the one wire format (wire(6)).

| Method | Kind | Since | Ordinal |
| `startSession` | call | 1 | `0x2dae4a6c2b85110e` |
| `publicKey` | call | 1 | `0x6a896670786173d2` |

: `startSession`
  Starts a session for `pattern` (factotum's: `proto=scram-sha-256
  server=mail.example user?`) in `role`: `session` is the server's
  end of an `AuthSession`.
: `publicKey`
  The public half of the key `pattern` names, made if need be:
  ed25519's and noise-ik's, for the app to give its peers.

